      "role": "user",
      "content": "That first option is good, but it feels a little too blunt. Could you try a version that's slightly more \"human\" or personable? I don't want him to feel attacked, just that I've noticed the pattern. Maybe something that acknowledges he's a busy guy but emphasizes how his presence matters to the rest of the team?",
